{"v":4,"catch":"點燃你的心之火！\n革命劇即刻上演!!","desc":"畢業典禮前夕，「心之怪盜團」的成員們在盧布朗咖啡廳度過休閒時光。\n突然間，店裡一陣天搖地動，盧布朗的門發出了詭異的光。\nJOKER一行人意外闖入了不可思議的異世界，\n而拯救他們的，是一名自稱「革命家艾露」的少女――\n\n《女神異聞錄５》系列最新作以策略模擬RPG之姿登場！\n不僅延續1MORE和總攻擊等戰鬥特色，\n更帶來與夥伴並肩作戰的暢快體驗！\n \n一同行動的「革命家艾露」的真面目究竟是……？\n她所提出的交易請求「協助革命」又是怎麼一回事……？\n敬請欣賞怪盜團一路奮鬥的革命劇！","publisher":"SEGA","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["角色扮演","策略","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 7.7GB / Switch 7.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2dca5c9fd9b1d81a8300d53092aea64cf679af2d63d685d3d47fa9071a038133.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e979ccfed8dcbd1cd306deb59a68222bb28739f349cb35a47ecd35c48b287b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a91ad80fd86f276db5fbfe996926fb834682bea66986827d6758d39a7dd62e4d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9e4a3861aafa6435d0062129ccb5d59a3876d04f3b724e7ea5488ccc0e7dc99f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8ef838c9894a4aa8d3cf944ea7097086ad58cac13f4eb9c18b4829859def2fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8eae5382eef79f2b14876ab3549a26de293e442bfa036c21e072d6c2134b3152.jpg"],"titleId":"010090901941e000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000044373","name":"新增劇情「Repaint Your Heart」","img":"27fba1c01a253d3e98142d7fa2010f97fd16e8914db98c2bf2e2bb541eff2663","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000044368","name":"召喚包「人格面具・賊神」&「勞爾」","img":"536e9a952e967c618334a857200e88ce0d8562c4cd4907b34f27a29e0503e17f","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000044370","name":"武器包「賊・系列」","img":"bcaa28c188aa5e9e85ca26a0cc2d6e27940a1f913389b4886724b834374f73c5","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false}],"vids":["rNXkPOSK8vU","62VcJmdUnmI","3lK7qye1SiE"]}